{
	"Set": [
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-21T18:58:09Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Inject security.workspace.trust.enabled=false by default\n\nAtom I7: Add logic to AppLifecycle to ensure the VS Code workspace trust system is disabled in User/settings.json. Without this, opening the Land repo as a workspace triggers VS Code's trust gate which marks built-in extensions as `DisabledByTrustRequirement` because they ship under `Element/Sky/Target/Static/Application/extensions/` — inside the repo.\n\nThis writes `\"security.workspace.trust.enabled\": false` only if the key isn't already present. Users can opt back in by editing their User/settings.json.\n\nThis ensures built-in extensions load reliably regardless of which folder the user picks as their workspace.",
			"SHA": "4da3261d6c115399b48925f7767f23efeb291678"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-21T18:33:23Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				11
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 11 components\n\nSynchronize Air, Cocoon, Common, Echo, Grove, Mountain, Output, Sky, Vine, Wind, and Worker submodules with the following changes:\n\n**Features:**\n- Mountain: Add .env.Land bootstrap at startup (Atom I5) - load environment from cwd/parent/repo-layout probe, forward Product/Tier/Network vars to Cocoon subprocess. Fix workspace activation not firing after folder pick (Atom I1) by mutating ApplicationState.Workspace before Window.navigate(). Add zombie-Cocoon prevention (Atom I6) with TCP-probe port 50052, lsof owner resolution, and SIGTERM→SIGKILL cascade.\n- Wind: Implement Atom I5 - refactor ResolveConfiguration to fetch product identity from /product.json generated by Maintain/Script/ResolveProductConfig.sh instead of hardcoded strings.\n\n**Chore:**\n- Sky: Bump version to 1.118.0, update quality to 'development', change nameLong to 'Land Editor', add embedderIdentifier field for desktop builds.\n\n**Style:**\n- Air, Common, Echo, Grove, Output, Vine, Worker: Normalize em-dashes (—) to ASCII hyphens (-) in CHANGELOG.md, documentation, and source comments for consistent typography.\n\nThis coordinated update delivers the .env.Land bootstrap architecture, fixes extension loading after folder picks, and prevents stale Cocoon processes.",
			"SHA": "3aef9ae1d660461bbd20a9ab546377a94e1ed9f4"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-21T16:45:34Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				11
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 11 components\n\nSynchronize Air, Cocoon, Common, Echo, Maintain, Mountain, Output, Rest, SideCar, Sky, and Wind submodules with the following changes:\n\n**Mountain Fix:**\n- Improve extension loading with MIME type override for JS/CSS/JSON/HTML/SVG assets\n- Remove debug_only gate on extension scan paths for release builds\n- Extend fallback timers with logging for Sky phase advancement\n- Add BATCH-16 latency instrumentation for RPC dispatch analysis\n- Add diagnostic:log bridge and extensions:getInstalled for sidebar\n\n**Dependency Updates:**\n- GitHub Actions: actions/setup-node (6.2.0/6.3.0 → 6.4.0), dependabot/fetch-metadata (3.0.0 → 3.1.0)\n- Common, Echo, Output, SideCar, Sky: @cloudflare/workers-types updates\n- Echo: Bump wrangler (4.83.0 → 4.84.0), miniflare (4.20260415.0 → 4.20260420.0)\n- Sky: Bump astro (6.1.7 → 6.1.8), vite (8.0.8 → 8.0.9)\n\nThis coordinated update ensures all Element components receive the latest dependency updates and Mountain fix.",
			"SHA": "67b1b736daf42b7cf5751f6cdf104609dc71549a"
		},
