			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize 6 Element submodules with dependency updates\n\nCoordinate submodule updates across Air, Cocoon, Grove, Mountain, Wind, and Worker with the following dependency changes:\n\n**GitHub Actions:**\n- Air, Grove, Mountain: Bump dependabot/fetch-metadata 3.0.0 → 3.1.0\n- Wind, Worker: Bump actions/setup-node (6.2.0/6.3.0 → 6.4.0)\n\n**npm dependencies:**\n- Wind: Bump effect 3.21.0 → 3.21.1\n- Wind: Bump @opentelemetry/* packages (sdk-metrics, sdk-trace-web, sdk-trace-base, sdk-logs, exporter-trace-otlp-http)\n- Worker: Bump @types/serviceworker 0.0.194 → 0.0.195\n\nThis coordinated update ensures all Element components receive the latest dependency updates.",
